              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weniwu diwu mukanda wansaŋu jaAdama muyavwalikiluwu yisakayindi. Hefuku daleŋeluwu muntu kudi Nzambi, wamwilili wakudifwana naNzambi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wayileŋeli niiyala nimumbanda; wayi kiswilili nkisu, wayitumbili ijina dawu mwifuku dayileŋeliyi, nindi, Adama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adama washakamininyaka nkulakaji nanyaka makumi asatu, yovwala ni mwana wamufwana, neyi chekalayi yomweni; yonamutumba niijina dindi nindi Seta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chavweliyi Seta, Adama wanuŋiluku nyaka makulakaji atanu namakulakaji asatu; wavweli anyana amayala nawambanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubomba nyakaye jima yahandiliyi Adama yashi kili munyaka makulakaji atanu namakulakaji awana nanyaka makumi asatu; yofwa ni kufwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
